<title>PORTUGAL: Banco Totta stock tradable from Nov 20.</title>
<headline>Banco Totta stock tradable from Nov 20.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 13.2 percent of Banco Totta &amp; Acores that the government is privatising will be tradeable on the Lisbon bourse from November 20, one day after the finalising of the sale, the bourse announced.</p>
<p>The bourse session to conclude the sale of the stake, the bulk of which is being sold directly to foreign and domestic institutional investors, has been set for November 19.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
